ike all seed models are  manufactured in salina in Slovakia at  Kia's European production site and like  every European Kia car this GT comes  with a seven-year warranty says the CGT  is really fun to drive even though it  can't quite keep up with the more  powerful golf GTI and similar cars but  the entry-level c GT is available for  just under twenty five thousand euros  that's five thousand euros less than the  golf GTI  I think Athene the c GT is available in  two equipment lines GT challenge and GT  track the latter comes with sin on  headlamps adaptive curve following front  lighting and a digital DAB radio this  upgrade cost 3000 euros and is well  worth considering
 

